{"diagnosis": "TRAP asserted with tohost FAIL 0xdead instead of clean NOP fetch progress. mem_rdata_latched_noshuffle holds stale mem_rdata_q instead of live mem_rdata during mem_xfer, so mem_rdata_latched decodes illegal. Root cause is line 384 gating with (mem_xfer && LATCHED_MEM_RDATA) which never selects mem_rdata for unlatched memory; it must be OR.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -382,5 +382,5 @@
 	assign mem_la_addr = (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst) ? {next_pc[31:2] + mem_la_firstword_xfer, 2'b00} : {reg_op1[31:2], 2'b00};

-	assign mem_rdata_latched_noshuffle = (mem_xfer && LATCHED_MEM_RDATA) ? mem_rdata : mem_rdata_q;
+	assign mem_rdata_latched_noshuffle = (mem_xfer || LATCHED_MEM_RDATA) ? mem_rdata : mem_rdata_q;

 	assign mem_rdata_latched = COMPRESSED_ISA && mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word ? {16'bx, mem_16bit_buffer} :
", "expected": "tohost PASS with no TRAP asserted, fetch alignment progress instead of FAIL 0xdead"}

